---
// gpu-fleet's architecture as it runs today, redrawn from the repo's architecture notes (compose.yaml,
// compose.obs.yaml, ADR 0002/0014/0017/0018). Solid lines run today; dashed ones are planned.
// Static SVG in the site's tokens, so it follows light and dark mode; no script.
import Figure from "../../design/components/Figure.astro";
---

<Figure caption="What runs today, all on one PC: solid lines run now, dashed ones are planned. Workers only ever call out; the broker never connects to them.">
  <svg class="fleet-arch" viewBox="0 0 400 640" role="img" aria-labelledby="fleet-arch-title fleet-arch-desc">
    <title id="fleet-arch-title">gpu-fleet architecture</title>
    <desc id="fleet-arch-desc">
      On one Windows PC, Docker Compose runs the broker, one to three workers, a results volume and an optional
      Grafana stack; Ollama runs natively on the AMD RX 9070. fleet-enqueue posts jobs to the broker with the admin
      token. Workers call the broker to lease, heartbeat and complete jobs, call Ollama to generate, and write
      results to the volume under a content hash. Broker and workers push telemetry to Grafana. Planned, outside the
      PC: a Cloud Run broker, notebook, Cloud Run Jobs and Kubernetes workers, and results in S3, where the buckets
      already exist but hold no jobs yet.
    </desc>
    <defs>
      <marker id="fa-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
        <path d="M0 0 10 5 0 10z" class="fa-head"></path>
      </marker>
      <marker id="fa-arrow-accent" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
        <path d="M0 0 10 5 0 10z" class="fa-head-accent"></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    {/* The PC */}
    <rect class="fa-frame" x="4" y="4" width="392" height="470"></rect>
    <text class="fa-kicker" x="16" y="24">ONE WINDOWS PC · DOCKER COMPOSE</text>

    {/* fleet-enqueue */}
    <rect class="fa-box" x="20" y="38" width="340" height="44"></rect>
    <text class="fa-name" x="34" y="58">fleet-enqueue</text>
    <text class="fa-note" x="34" y="74">adds jobs with the admin token</text>
    <line class="fa-line" x1="190" y1="82" x2="190" y2="118" marker-end="url(#fa-arrow)"></line>
    <text class="fa-label" x="198" y="104">POST /jobs</text>

    {/* broker */}
    <rect class="fa-box" x="20" y="120" width="340" height="62"></rect>
    <text class="fa-name" x="34" y="141">broker</text>
    <text class="fa-note" x="34" y="158">FastAPI + SQLite (WAL)</text>
    <text class="fa-note" x="34" y="174">leases, heartbeats, dead letters</text>

    {/* worker pulls from broker */}
    <line class="fa-line fa-pull" x1="190" y1="234" x2="190" y2="184" marker-end="url(#fa-arrow-accent)"></line>
    <text class="fa-label fa-label-accent" x="198" y="205">lease · heartbeat · complete</text>
    <text class="fa-label" x="198" y="221">worker token + traceparent</text>

    {/* worker */}
    <rect class="fa-box" x="20" y="236" width="340" height="44"></rect>
    <text class="fa-name" x="34" y="256">worker × 1–3</text>
    <text class="fa-note" x="34" y="272">runner: echo, or smoke on the GPU</text>

    {/* worker to Ollama and results */}
    <line class="fa-line" x1="105" y1="280" x2="105" y2="318" marker-end="url(#fa-arrow)"></line>
    <text class="fa-label" x="112" y="304">generate</text>
    <line class="fa-line" x1="275" y1="280" x2="275" y2="318" marker-end="url(#fa-arrow)"></line>
    <text class="fa-label" x="282" y="304">put(hash)</text>

    <rect class="fa-box" x="20" y="320" width="166" height="62"></rect>
    <text class="fa-name" x="32" y="341">Ollama</text>
    <text class="fa-note" x="32" y="358">native, outside Docker</text>
    <text class="fa-note" x="32" y="374">AMD RX 9070 (ROCm)</text>

    <rect class="fa-box" x="194" y="320" width="166" height="62"></rect>
    <text class="fa-name" x="206" y="341">results volume</text>
    <text class="fa-note" x="206" y="358">content-addressed:</text>
    <text class="fa-note" x="206" y="374">a rerun is harmless</text>

    {/* telemetry lane on the right */}
    <path class="fa-line" d="M360 151 H380 V428 H362" marker-end="url(#fa-arrow)"></path>
    <path class="fa-line" d="M360 258 H380"></path>

    <rect class="fa-box" x="20" y="406" width="340" height="44"></rect>
    <text class="fa-name" x="34" y="426">Grafana stack (opt-in)</text>
    <text class="fa-note" x="34" y="442">OTLP in · Prometheus, Tempo, Loki</text>

    {/* planned */}
    <text class="fa-kicker" x="16" y="504">PLANNED · PHASE 4 ONWARDS</text>
    <rect class="fa-box fa-planned" x="20" y="516" width="340" height="44"></rect>
    <text class="fa-name fa-muted" x="34" y="536">Cloud Run broker; workers on</text>
    <text class="fa-note" x="34" y="552">notebooks, Cloud Run Jobs, Kubernetes</text>
    <line class="fa-line fa-planned" x1="190" y1="560" x2="190" y2="584" marker-end="url(#fa-arrow)"></line>
    <rect class="fa-box fa-planned" x="20" y="586" width="340" height="44"></rect>
    <text class="fa-name fa-muted" x="34" y="606">AWS S3 results, presigned URLs</text>
    <text class="fa-note" x="34" y="622">buckets exist (Terraform), 0 objects</text>
  </svg>
</Figure>

<style>
  .fleet-arch {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 30rem;
    height: auto;
    font-family: var(--font-text);
  }
  .fa-frame {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--rule-soft);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }
  .fa-box {
    fill: var(--raised);
    stroke: var(--ink);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }
  .fa-planned {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--muted);
    stroke-dasharray: 5 4;
  }
  .fa-line {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--ink);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }
  .fa-pull {
    stroke: var(--accent);
    stroke-width: 2;
  }
  .fa-head {
    fill: var(--ink);
  }
  .fa-head-accent {
    fill: var(--accent);
  }
  .fa-name {
    fill: var(--ink);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .fa-note,
  .fa-label {
    fill: var(--muted);
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .fa-label-accent {
    fill: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .fa-muted {
    fill: var(--muted);
  }
  .fa-kicker {
    fill: var(--muted);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }
</style>
